      "text": "**Create `.github/workflows/release.yml`: triggered on v* tag push**\n- [ ] Job: docker (multi-arch GHCR push)\n- [ ] Job: binary-macos (PyInstaller ARM64)\n- [ ] Job: binary-linux (PyInstaller x86_64, works in tmux/SSH/phone)\n- [ ] Job: binary-windows (PyInstaller x86_64 .exe)\n- [ ] Job: app-macos (PyInstaller --windowed + DMG)\n- [ ] Job: pypi (build + publish)\n- [ ] Job: release (GitHub Release with all artifacts)\n- [ ] Job: update-brew (SHA256 \u2192 homebrew-apps)\n\n`#ci`\n`TODO.md:L196`",
